cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "induced-gravity-count: the Standard Model's induced Newton constant, counted exactly"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Swanson
    given-names: "David T."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-0580-6476"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidtswanson903/induced-gravity-count"
keywords:
  - induced gravity
  - Sakharov
  - Newton constant
  - Standard Model
  - heat kernel
  - Lean 4
abstract: >
  The sign of the Standard Model's induced Newton constant as an exact count over species,
  with its conditions stated. Every number in the accompanying paper is generated by this
  repository, and the counts and the identities they rest on are machine-checked in Lean 4
  against a second implementation in Python.
